{
  "name": "mascot-avatars",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Procedural SVG mascot avatars in the IP-as-Logo style: rounded shapes, two colors, solid background, deterministic from a seed. Companion to the AI skill — not an SVG fallback for image models.",
